            "To evaluate the results quantitatively, we assign different scores for the options: \\textit{Very Poor=1, Poor=2, Good=3, Excellent=4}. From Tab. \\ref{tab:appendix_human}, all experts agree that the output from our model is the best, followed by InstructBLIP in second place, and MMGPT performs the worst. \n",
